sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Customer
    participant A as Authorised representative
    participant P as Approved payment channel
    participant F as Principal/TCorp finance
    participant S as Collection platform

    Note over C,S: Illustrative and unconfirmed until TEKUN Corporation validates the flow

    A->>C: Explain approved payment route
    C->>P: Make payment directly
    P->>F: Provide transaction evidence
    F->>S: Confirm/import payment evidence
    S->>S: Match, reconcile and update case
    S-->>A: Stop or adjust collection action
    S-->>F: Exception or completed reconciliation report
